Water, Glycerin, Methylpropanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, Sodium DNA, Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, Adenosine, Panthenol, Allantoin, Trehalose, Butylene Glycol, Carbomer, Tromethamine, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Disodium EDTA, Fragrance, Agar, Acacia Senegal Gum, Caprylyl Glycol.

