Water, Cyclomethicone, Glycerin, Cetyl Alcohol, Camellia Japonica Seed Oil, Polysorbate 60, Isopropyl Myristate, Guar Hydroxypropyltrimonium Chloride, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, Polyquaternium-10, Fragance, Ethylhexylglycerin, Caprylyl Glycol, Panthenol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Disodium EDTA, 1,10-Decanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Butylene Glycol, Glycine, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Serine, Glutamic Acid, Aspartic Acid, Leucine, Alanine, Lysine, Arginine, Tyrosine, Phenylalanine, Threonine, Proline, Valine, Isoleucine, Histidine, Cysteine, Methionine

