-Aplicar después de la limpieza: usar con palmas o pads, presionando suavemente.


-Usar mañana y noche para mejores resultados de hidratación y calma.


Contenido neto: 250 ml
Ingredientes
 Water, Glycerin, Methylpropanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, PDRN (Polydeoxyribonucleotide), Centella Asiatica Extract, Allantoin, Xylitol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Adenosine, Sodium DNA, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Fruit Extract, Gluconolactone, Carica Papaya (Papaya) Fruit Extract, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Extract, Prunus Domestica (Plum) Fruit Extract, Copper Tripeptide-1, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Fructooligosaccharides, Fructose, Glucose, Betaine, Butylene Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxyacetophenone, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Tocopherol, Xanthan Gum, Disodium EDTA.') ON CONFLICT (sku) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, ean = EXCLUDED.ean, brand_id = EXCLUDED.brand_id, priority = EXCLUDED.priority, format = EXCLUDED.format, description_short = EXCLUDED.description_short, description_full = EXCLUDED.description_full;
INSERT INTO public.products (id, sku, name, ean, brand_id, priority, format, description_short, description_full) VALUES (789, '18747', 'MEDICUBE Gel de Baño Corporal Red Acne Body Wash 2.0 400 g', '8809936587119', 50, 'ALTA', '400g', '18747', 'Gel de limpieza corporal formulado para pieles con acné corporal, que ayuda a limpiar profundamente, controlar el exceso de sebo y mejorar la apariencia de imperfecciones sin resecar la piel.

